{"2812420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Holiday Motel Simulator", "steam_appid": 2812420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Holiday Motel Simulator</i>, you start with peeling paint, broken sinks, and plenty of guest complaints — and turn it all into a cozy, five-star experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/fe568b9c4792a053d428d7877b2987bc.poster.avif?t=1758725356\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/fe568b9c4792a053d428d7877b2987bc.webm?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/fe568b9c4792a053d428d7877b2987bc.mp4?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, renovate, and redesign every corner of your motel, from water-damaged rooms to rusty pipes and worn-out furniture. Use your creativity and a wide range of decorations to give each room a unique vibe — go rustic, retro, or modern minimalist. It’s up to you to create spaces that guests won’t want to leave.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/9e2c1d909cf4c9b24a86ef891680cc06.poster.avif?t=1758725356\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/9e2c1d909cf4c9b24a86ef891680cc06.webm?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/9e2c1d909cf4c9b24a86ef891680cc06.mp4?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the paint’s dry, it’s time to manage the business. Set prices, take care of bookings, respond to guest feedback, and keep everything running smoothly. Every decision counts — happy customers mean better reviews, and better reviews mean more bookings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/2d3992d0543b4a1f1de25e5e10b133e6.poster.avif?t=1758725356\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/2d3992d0543b4a1f1de25e5e10b133e6.webm?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/2d3992d0543b4a1f1de25e5e10b133e6.mp4?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From fixing leaky faucets to decorating dream suites, every detail matters. Will your motel become the next hidden gem on the map? The keys are in your hands.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Holiday Motel Simulator</i>, you start with peeling paint, broken sinks, and plenty of guest complaints — and turn it all into a cozy, five-star experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/fe568b9c4792a053d428d7877b2987bc.poster.avif?t=1758725356\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/fe568b9c4792a053d428d7877b2987bc.webm?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/fe568b9c4792a053d428d7877b2987bc.mp4?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, renovate, and redesign every corner of your motel, from water-damaged rooms to rusty pipes and worn-out furniture. Use your creativity and a wide range of decorations to give each room a unique vibe — go rustic, retro, or modern minimalist. It’s up to you to create spaces that guests won’t want to leave.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/9e2c1d909cf4c9b24a86ef891680cc06.poster.avif?t=1758725356\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/9e2c1d909cf4c9b24a86ef891680cc06.webm?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/9e2c1d909cf4c9b24a86ef891680cc06.mp4?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the paint’s dry, it’s time to manage the business. Set prices, take care of bookings, respond to guest feedback, and keep everything running smoothly. Every decision counts — happy customers mean better reviews, and better reviews mean more bookings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/2d3992d0543b4a1f1de25e5e10b133e6.poster.avif?t=1758725356\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/2d3992d0543b4a1f1de25e5e10b133e6.webm?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/extras/2d3992d0543b4a1f1de25e5e10b133e6.mp4?t=1758725356\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From fixing leaky faucets to decorating dream suites, every detail matters. Will your motel become the next hidden gem on the map? The keys are in your hands.</p>", "short_description": "Start with a crumbling motel and transform it into a guest favorite. Clean, repair, decorate, manage bookings, and expand — your hospitality empire begins here.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish, French, German, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/a2c0525271326d88334c9eea26ebcbb89cf265c5/header.jpg?t=1758725356", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/68b274dd999d870a1ca3fe6a6677215acec136c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758725356", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2812420/68b274dd999d870a1ca3fe6a6677215acec136c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758725356", "website": "https://www.red-phoenix.eu", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F / AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / GTX 1650 4GB / RTX 2050 4GB or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any Windows-compatible audio device<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Stable performance on low settings / FULLSCREEN mode. FPS can be limited to 30–60 in the in-game options. (SSD recommended)</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-12700H / AMD Ryzen 7 5800H or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16